__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store
.wrangler/

# Library of Congress scans of the U.S. Reports: too large for git; `make fetch` restores them (decision 48)
sources/raw/loc-usrep-*.pdf
# Internet Archive scans of the Annals of Congress (DjVu XML and page images, over the 40 MB per-file budget): `make fetch` restores them (decision 46)
sources/raw/ia-annals-*
# Internet Archive scans of the Congressional Globe (the microfilm's DjVu XML, 201 MB; the Michigan copy's OCR text): `make fetch` restores them (decision 47)
sources/raw/ia-globe-*
# The bound Congressional Record's govinfo PDFs (one per house per day) and the Internet Archive's microfilm OCR of its parts: `make fetch` restores them (decision 61)
sources/raw/govinfo-crecb-*
sources/raw/ia-record-*
# The Library of Congress's typed transcription of Elliot's Debates, vols. 2-4, and the Internet Archive's scans of vols. 2 and 4 it is checked against: `make fetch` restores them (decision 68)
sources/raw/loc-lled-*
sources/raw/ia-elliot-v[24]-*
